; exports.def - module definition file for Assembly.dll
; stdcall symbols are normally decorated (_SignUp@8); listing the plain names here
; exports them undecorated, so Python can call asm.SignUp, asm.Login, ...
; Only names that exist as PROCs in main.asm may be listed.
; After editing: Rebuild Solution.
LIBRARY Assembly
EXPORTS
    SignUp
    Login
    Logout
    Deposit
    Withdraw
    GetBalance
    AttemptsLeft
    GetRule
    GetUserCount
    ExportUser
    ImportUser
